# LobeHub (lqdflying/lobehub)

Custom fork/distribution of LobeChat, maintained independently starting at v3.0.0. Targets **self-hosted Docker + PostgreSQL only**. Docker image: `docker.io/lqdflying/lobehub`.

Upstream: https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-chat — diverged significantly. **Do not blindly sync upstream changes.**

## Tech Stack

- **Frontend**: Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript — hybrid Next.js App Router + SPA (`react-router-dom`)
- **UI**: `@lobehub/ui`, Ant Design, `antd-style` (CSS-in-JS via `createStyles`)
- **State**: Zustand stores + SWR for server data
- **Backend**: tRPC + Next.js API routes
- **Database**: PostgreSQL only (server mode), Drizzle ORM
- **Testing**: Vitest + Testing Library (unit), Playwright + Cucumber (e2e)
- **Monorepo**: pnpm workspaces; use `bun` for scripts, `bunx` for executables

## Naming Conventions (Critical)

**Always match existing patterns before inventing new names.**

- AI provider variables: `minimax_*`, `kimi_*`, `openai_*` — follow the provider's config file pattern
- DB columns: `camelCase` (Drizzle convention)
- React components: `PascalCase.tsx`
- Hooks: `use*.ts`
- Tests: `__tests__/` directories or `.test.ts` suffix

## Provider model options (extendParams / gear menu)

Adding or changing **per-model** API options (new provider module, new toggles) must follow **`.cursor/rules/provider-model-options.mdc`** (docs-first, end-to-end mapping, one provider panel at a time).
